    "host_hotspots": "Top hosts are sampled separately so a high-volume domain cannot hide a domain-specific extraction failure behind global averages.",
    "wds_bin": "Up to 200 rows per WDS bin: about +/-7 percentage-point within-bin 95% CI half-width at worst-case prevalence."
